      "id": "prompt_001",
      "text": "今日、思わず笑ってしまったことは何ですか？",
      "promptLanguage": "ja",
      "posts": [
        {
          "id": "A27331CF-683D-46E7-84FE-00FD8A513A16",
          "authorID": "F71DC8ED-6519-4F76-9CBD-0ED21889C3C5",
          "authorEmoji": "🌙",
          "authorNickname": "みずき",
          "body": "電車で寝てる人が、急にはっきりした声で「それは違うと思います」って言った。誰と話してたんやろ。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 18
        },
        {
          "id": "A08195C4-4A4C-40BD-91BE-159E77C57C7A",
          "authorID": "1E56339E-92A5-481A-923D-72C2048CF18C",
          "authorEmoji": "🐢",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "My cat tried to jump onto the table, missed completely, and then walked away like nothing had happened.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
