          "authorEmoji": "🌿",
          "authorNickname": "はるか",
          "body": "「いつもありがとう」って、母に言われた。当たり前のことをしてるつもりやったのに。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 21
        },
        {
          "id": "5ED288D2-2979-49AC-B99C-EF38BC68BE0A",
          "authorID": "E63C7BC7-7EA4-4B0C-BEE5-A34FFE01F310",
          "authorEmoji": "🧦",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "A stranger told me my laugh made his day better. I have been self-conscious about it for years.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
