          "authorID": "53AEED3B-B0AF-42B3-B213-27E6906015B7",
          "authorEmoji": "🌊",
          "authorNickname": "Mateo",
          "body": "Mi hija me dijo: \"papá, contigo no tengo miedo\". Me quedé sin palabras.",
          "bodyLanguage": "es",
          "minutesAgo": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "96D63DD8-2A85-452C-B403-2E6DF6C72110",
          "authorID": "B1B6C79D-F7FD-46A5-B72A-B1D26E579417",
          "authorEmoji": "🎹",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "Une collègue m'a dit que je posais toujours les bonnes questions. Je pensais juste être curieux.",
          "bodyLanguage": "fr",
          "minutesAgo": 113
        },
        {
          "id": "997475B3-0B2D-4280-AE30-EA9683152055",
          "authorID": "6705289F-4F47-42F9-8622-27299566FE47",
          "authorEmoji": "🧶",
          "authorNickname": "Elke",
          "body": "Meine Nachbarin sagte, das Haus sei freundlicher geworden, seit ich hier wohne.",
          "bodyLanguage": "de",
          "minutesAgo": 136
        },
        {
          "id": "DAF9743C-7CDB-473F-9EE0-A15851F47D42",
          "authorID": "8DD02152-4A1D-4891-B5DF-F0FD89E8E741",
          "authorEmoji": "🥚",
          "authorNickname": "Rafa",
          "body": "Meu chefe disse que confia em mim. Foi só isso, mas carreguei essa frase o dia todo.",
          "bodyLanguage": "pt",
          "minutesAgo": 159
        },
        {
          "id": "8D179A30-B0D3-421C-8B61-CE8ED779B266",
          "authorID": "74E85C2A-305D-47DD-91BB-00231C11A004",
          "authorEmoji": "🐿️",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "弟弟说：“哥，我想变成你这样的人。”我偷偷高兴了很久。",
          "bodyLanguage": "zh",
          "minutesAgo": 182
        },
        {
          "id": "CB9B9255-683E-4E0B-830C-E224EB434D21",
          "authorID": "C712DA6A-92DC-474A-970A-A79E7FE6224D",
          "authorEmoji": "🌙",
          "authorNickname": "Layla",
          "body": "قال لي صديقي: \"وجودك يريحني\". لم أعرف بماذا أرد.",
          "bodyLanguage": "ar",
          "minutesAgo": 205
        },
        {
          "id": "A6F50034-4E24-4DBD-853D-C6E82C7150E0",
          "authorID": "A51AB2CE-A716-4D27-96CA-B9F1DFB4B9C7",
          "authorEmoji": "🍅",
          "authorNickname": "Giulia",
          "body": "Un cliente mi ha detto che il mio pane sa di casa sua. Lavoro da vent'anni per una frase così.",
          "bodyLanguage": "it",
          "minutesAgo": 228
        },
        {
